apTable() packed together several\nindependent decisions (full vs. partial vs. continuous update, whether\nthe main table exists, how the database manages partitions, and how to\npublish: replace/reparent/merge) into nested conditionals.\n\nExtract a TableUpdateAction enum (REPLACE_TABLE, REPLACE_PARTITIONS,\nMERGE_ROWS) and a resolveUpdateAction() method that makes the decision\nonce, up front, then dispatches to three small named methods.\n\nThis also generalizes the two fail-loudly behaviors from the previous\ncommit from Doris-only to any declarative-partitioning engine without\ncontinuous analytics support (currently ClickHouse): a continuous\n(lastYears=0) or bounded (lastYears=1..N) update against an existing\nmain table on such an engine now throws instead of silently discarding\nthe rebuilt staging data, since there is no purge step available to\nmake either publish safe.\n\n🤖 AI Assisted","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"37201c94c64295e399ca12fcc060b4848a3bfd23","tree_id":"d2b002ebc1dfb9f4e358f93d01727b8433b38a76","timestamp":"2026-09-28T10:34:38Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/5591308","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.githu